\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. That day of wrath, that dreadful
\par day
\par When heaven and earth shall
\par pass away:
\par What power shall be the sinner's stay?
\par How shall we meet that dreadful day?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. When, shrivelling like a parched 
\par scroll,
\par The flaming heavens together roll,
\par When louder yet, and yet more dread,
\par Swells the high trump that wakes
\par the dead.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O! On that day, that wrathful day,
\par When man to judgement wakes
\par from clay,
\par Be Thou, O Christ, the sinner's stay,
\par Though heaven and earth shall pass
\par away.
\par                                                 Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

